     <note type="work_relations" cert="high">
      <p>These notes represent a fragmentary draft of the essay "Five Thousand Poems," first published in <hi rend="italic">The Critic</hi>, April 16, 1887. The essay later appeared in <hi rend="italic">November Boughs</hi> (1888) and was retained when <hi rend="italic">November Boughs</hi> was incorporated into <hi rend="italic">Complete Prose Works</hi> in 1892.</p>
     </note>
