 <text type="manuscript">
  <body>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="loc_ew.00589.jpg" type="recto"/>
   
   <note type="authorial" place="top" rend="marked" hand="#h04">Note</note>
   <note type="authorial" place="top"><subst rend="overwrite"><del hand="#h02">Note</del><add place="inline" hand="#h04">Note A &#42;</add></subst></note>
   <p><subst>
    <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02" seq="1">I <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02">say I</del> should be illy understood</del> 
    <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01" seq="5"><add place="above" hand="#h02" seq="2">This Preface <add place="above" hand="#h02" seq="3">or whatever <add place="above" hand="#h02" seq="4">at all</add> it is,</add> would be illy <gap reason="illegible" extent="one word"/></add></del></subst> While I am about it I should <del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike"><add place="above">not only</add></del> if <del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike"><subst hand="#h02"><add seq="2" place="above">it</add> <del seq="1">I</del></subst> did not</del> <add place="above">like to</add> put on record, <add hand="#h01" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add> <add place="above" xml:id="a001"><subst><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01" seq="1">beyond possible misunderstanding,</del> <add hand="#h02" place="above" seq="2">here</add></subst></add> my devout acknowledgment <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a002">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" rend="marked" xml:id="a002">not only of the great masterpieces of the past, but</add> of the supreme benefit of <hi rend="underline">all</hi> poets, <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a003">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a003">past and present</add> and <hi rend="underline">all</hi> <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">poetry&#8212;</del> <add place="above" seq="2">poetic utterances&#8212;</add></subst><add hand="#h04">,</add><add hand="#h04" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a004">&#8248;</metamark></add><add hand="#h01" place="above" xml:id="a004">in its entirety</add> the dominant <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">spiritual</del> <add place="above" seq="2">moral</add></subst> factor of humanity's progress. T<gap reason="cut away"/></p>
<note type="archival" place="bottom" hand="#h05">307</note>

<pb xml:id="leaf001v" facs="loc_es.01064_large.jpg" type="verso"/>
   
<pb xml:id="leaf002r" facs="loc_ew.00146.jpg" type="recto"/>
   
   <p>In view of <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the past,</del> <add place="above" seq="2">that progress,</add></subst> and of evolution, the <addSpan rend="pasteon" spanTo="#a006"/>religious element <unclear reason="illegible" resp="#bb" cert="medium">the most</unclear> important of any, <subst hand="#h02"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">is</del> <add place="inline" seq="2"><metamark function="add" target="#a007">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a007" hand="h02">seems to me</add></subst> more indebted to poetry than to all other means and influences combined. In a very profound sense, religion <hi rend="underline">is</hi> the poetry of humanity, <del rend="overstrike" hand="h04">and neither could exist without the other</del><del rend="overstrike">. . . . The</del></p>
   <p><del rend="overstrike">Then, after all is said, and the seemingly unfathomable gaps and contrasts pointed out, the</del> points of union and rapport among all the <del rend="overstrike">distinctive</del> poems <add place="below" hand="h02"><metamark function="add" target="#a008">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a008" hand="h02">and last,</add> of the world&#8212;however wide their separations of time and place&#8212;<add place="inline"><metamark function="add" target="#a009">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a009">and theme&#8212;</add><del rend="overstrike"><gap extent="one word" reason="torn away"/> curiously so</del> much more <gap extent="several letters" reason="torn away"/>rous and weighty than <gap extent="one to two words" reason="torn away"/>ints of contrast.</p><anchor xml:id="a006"/>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf002v" facs="loc_ew.00147.jpg" type="verso"/>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf003r" facs="loc_ew.00580.jpg" type="recto"/>
   
   <p><del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike"><add hand="#h01">Another point on which</add></del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01"><add  hand="#h01"><unclear reason="illegible" resp="#bb" cert="medium">I</unclear></add></del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01"><add hand="#h01">d</add></del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01"><add hand="#h01">which must be admitted</add></del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">Divergent and</del><subst rend="overwrite"><del><metamark function="question">?</metamark></del><add hand="#h03"><subst hand="#h01" rend="overwrite"><del>d</del><add>D</add></subst>istinctive</add></subst> 
    <add hand="#h01" place="inline">
     <metamark function="add" target="#a010">&#8248;</metamark></add><add hand="#h01" place="above" xml:id="a010">and without relation</add>
    as they seem at first sight all <add hand="#h04" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a011">&#8248;</metamark></add><add hand="#h04" place="above" xml:id="a011">the world's</add> Poets and all <add hand="#h04" place="above">its</add> Poetry, <del rend="overstrike">of</del> <del rend="overstrike"><add place="above">all varieties&#8212;</add></del> 
    <del rend="overstrike">all</del> 
    <del rend="overstrike"><add place="above">the</add></del> <add place="above"><del rend="overstrike">with</del>
     
     all varieties&#8212;</add> 
    <del rend="overstrike">lands of the globe, all <subst><del seq="1" rend="overstrike">times</del> <add seq="2" place="above">uses</add></subst>, from <del rend="overstrike">the</del> primitive times on and <gap reason="illegible" extent="one or two characters"/> on to the <del rend="overstrike">prent</del> present<add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a012">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a012">day inclusive&#8212;</add>&#8212;all tongues, all <del rend="overstrike">themes</del> forms, all subjects, all sizes or long 
     <del rend="overstrike"><add place="above"><gap reason="illegible" extent="one to three characters"/></add></del> or short&#8212;</del><add place="above">the <del rend="overstrike">Asiatic?</del></add> Oriental, the Greek, <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the</del>
      <add hand="#h01" place="above" seq="2">with </add></subst> 
    what there is of Roman, &#8212;<add place="inline"><metamark function="add" target="#a013">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a013">&#8212;the oldest myths&#8212;</add> <del hand="#h03" rend="overstrike">the Scandi-navian, the</del> <del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike">older Teutonic<add hand="#h03"></add>,</del> <del hand="#h03" rend="overstrike">Walter of A</del> <del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike">or</del> <del rend="overstrike"><add hand="#h03">the B</add></del> <del rend="overstrike">the P</del> <del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike">from</del> the <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">British Islands,</del><milestone unit="glued"/>
    &#8212;<del hand="#h03" rend="overstrike"><gap reason="illegible" extent="one or two words"/>&#8212;lyric&#8212;</del><del rend="overstrike">&#8212;the <add place="above">oldest</add> myths</del>&#8212;<del rend="overstrike">of old,</del> 
    the<add hand="#h01" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a014">&#8248;</metamark></add><add hand="#h01" place="above" xml:id="a014">interminable</add> ballad<del hand="#h01" rend="overstrike">s</del><add hand="#h01" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a015">&#8248;</metamark></add><add hand="#h01" place="above" xml:id="a015"><del rend="overstrike"><unclear reason="illegible" resp="#bb" cert="medium">la</unclear> lays and</del> romances</add> of the middle ages<subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">,</del><add seq="2">;</add></subst> <del rend="overstrike">or of</del> the hymns and <del rend="overstrike">psla</del> psalms of worship,<add place="above">&#8212;the great</add> <add hand="#h03">&#8212;epics<add hand="#h02">,</add> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02">or</del><add hand="#h02" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a016">&#8248;</metamark></add> <add place="above" hand="#h02" rend="marked" xml:id="a016">and <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h04">innumerable</del> <add hand="#h04"><unclear reason="illegible" resp="#bb" cert="high">swarms</unclear> of</add></add> lyrics&#8212;</add><add hand="#h01">&#8212;poems from the British Islands&#8212; <add hand="#h02">or</add> the Teutonic, old or new&#8212;</add><milestone unit="glued"/><del hand="#h04" rend="overstrike">Goethe's</del>, <add place="above">or</add> modern French and British</p>
   <note place="bottom" type="archival" hand="#h06">291B</note>
   <milestone unit="glued"/>
   <note place="bottom" type="archival" hand="#h06">291A</note>
   <pb xml:id="leaf003v" facs="loc_nk.00527_large.jpg" type="verso"/>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf004r" facs="loc_ew.00579.jpg" type="recto"/>
   
   <addSpan rend="pasteon" spanTo="#a030" hand="#h02"/>

   <p>
    <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02"><add place="above" hand="#h02">or</add>Tennysons,</del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02">in <unclear reason="illegible" cert="low" resp="#bb">our</unclear></del> or <add hand="#h01">Roundly considered.</add> what there is in America, (<subst hand="#h02"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">Poe's</del> <add place="above" seq="2">Bryant's</add></subst> for instance, 
    <subst hand="#h02">
     <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">or Bryants.</del> <add place="above" seq="2">or Whittier's),</add> <add place="below" seq="2">or Longfellow's</add></subst>)&#8212;<add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a017">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a017">verse of</add> all 
    <subst hand="#h02"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">subjects</del> <add seq="2">tongues</add></subst>, all forms, <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">all</del> <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a018">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="below" xml:id="a018">languages,</add> 
    subjects, 
    <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01"><add place="above" hand="#h02">&#8212;</add></del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">all</del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02"><add place="above" hand="#h02">all</add> 
     sizes, or long or short</del>&#8212;<del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">all</del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h04">the</del><add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a019">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a019" seq="1"><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">the</del> <del rend="overstrike" seq="2">songs</del></add> &amp; 
    <subst hand="#h02"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">lands</del> 
     <add place="above" seq="2"><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">singing</del></add></subst><add place="inline" hand="#h04">,</add> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h04">of the <subst><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02" seq="1">globe</del> 
      <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01" seq="3"><add place="above" hand="#h02" seq="2">earth</add>, all</del></subst> ages</del> from <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">the</del> primitive times to 
    <subst hand="#h02">
     <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">the present</del> 
     <add place="above" seq="2">our own</add>
    </subst> day, inclusive&#8212;&#8212;<add place="below" hand="#h01"><metamark function="add" target="#a020">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" hand="#h01" xml:id="a020">&#8212;really</add>
    combine in one 
    <add place="below" hand="#h02">
     <metamark function="add" target="#a021">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" hand="#h02" xml:id="a021"><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02"><add place="above" hand="#h02">digested</add></del> aggregate <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02"><add place="above" hand="#h02"><unclear reason="illegible" cert="medium" resp="#bb">compact</unclear></add></del> and</add> electric <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a022">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" rend="marked" xml:id="a022"><del rend="overstrike">compact</del> globe or</add>  
    universe <add hand="#h02" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a031">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike"><add place="above" hand="#h02" xml:id="a031">mark'd off from the rest,</add></del> 
    <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">held together</del> with all its 
    <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02">ra<gap reason="illegible" extent="one letter"/></del> 
    <add place="below" hand="#h02"><metamark function="add" target="#a023">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" hand="#h02" xml:id="a023">numberless parts and</add> 
    radiations <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02">in</del> <add hand="#h01" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a032">&#8248;</metamark></add><add hand="#h01" place="above" xml:id="a032">held together</add> by <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02">one <unclear reason="illegible" cert="medium" resp="#bb">sp</unclear></del> <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01">one</del> <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1" hand="#h01">central</del> <add place="above" hand="#h01" seq="2">a common</add></subst> <add place="above" hand="02"></add>
    
    
    <add place="inline" hand="#h01"><metamark>&#8248;</metamark></add> by <del rend="overstrike">one of</del> 
    <subst><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01" seq="1">one</del><add place="above" hand="#h01" seq="2">a</add></subst> 
    <subst><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h01" seq="1">central</del><add place="above" hand="#h01" seq="2">common</add></subst>
    <add place="inline" rend="marked" hand="#h01"><metamark function="add" target="#a024">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" hand="#h02" xml:id="a024" rend="marked">centre or</add> verteber<subst hand="#h02"><del rend="overstrike" seq="2"><add place="inline" hand="#h01" seq="1">, and</add></del> <add place="above" seq="3">&#8212;all</add></subst>
   
   <note type="archival" hand="#h05" place="left">289</note>
   <anchor xml:id="a030"/>

   
   <handShift new="#h01"/>having (to the point of view <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02">ample enough,</del> comprehensive enough) <del rend="overstrike"><add place="above"><gap reason="illegible" extent="one word"/> holding more)</add></del> <add place="below"><del rend="overstrike">having</del> more 
    <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">points</del> <add place="above" seq="2">features</add></subst> of</add> p resemblance than difference, and essentially, like this <add place="above" hand="#h02">planetary</add> globe itself, <del rend="overstrike">rounded,</del> compact and <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a025">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a025">orbic and</add> whole.</p>
   
   <note type="archival" hand="#h06" place="bottom">289A</note>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf004v" facs="loc_nk.00523_large.jpg" type="verso"/>
   <pb xml:id="leaf005r" facs="loc_ew.00581.jpg" type="recto"/>
   
   <p><del rend="overstrike">Yes, Poetry 
    <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a0261">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" rend="marked" xml:id="a026">may be considered, among the rest,</add> as a rounded, orbic whole, 
    <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a027">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a027">inclusive of every thing.</add></del>
   <milestone unit="undeclared" rend="horbar_full"/>
   That there should be a good deal of waste land and <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a028">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a028">many</add>
    sterile spots is an inherent necessity of the case&#8218;perhaps that the greater part of the rondure should be waste. Nature sows countless seeds 
    <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a029">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" rend="marked" xml:id="a029">makes incessant<del rend="overstrike">ly</del> crude attempts&#8212;</add>&#8212;thankful to get now and then something approximately good.</p>
   
   <pb xml:id="leaf005v" facs="loc_nk.00585_large.jpg" type="verso"/>
   
   
